<section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">What it does</div>
  <h2 style="max-width:640px">A recorder you never have to start</h2>
  <div class="whatgrid">
    <div><b>It's always on tape.</b> The last minute of your screen is buffered in memory, all the time. Missing a moment becomes impossible.</div>
    <div><b>Your game comes first.</b> Recording happens on your graphics card, not your processor, light enough to run while gaming on lower-end PCs.</div>
    <div><b>Nothing to manage.</b> No projects, no editing, no 200 GB folders of raw footage. Every clip is a ready-to-share MP4.</div>
    <div><b>Nothing to pay, ever.</b> Open source under GPL. No account, no subscription, no ads, no data collection.</div>
  </div>
</div></section>
